3. EDA Process 
In this project, EDA helped clean and organize the COVID-19 data so it could be used 
effectively for analysis and visualization. The following steps were carried out: 
• Checked for missing values and filled or removed them where needed 
• Standardized column names by converting them to lowercase and replacing 
spaces with underscores 
• Converted date columns to proper datetime format for easier sorting and filtering 
• Removed duplicate records to avoid errors in analysis 
• Cleaned up incorrect or invalid entries in the age group and vaccination status 
columns 
• Dropped columns with too many missing values that could not be used 
• Sorted the data by reporting dates to observe changes over time 
• Filtered the dataset to include only valid age groups for more accurate insight 
